ght him throughout his life, spreading wisdom and kindness wherever he went.\n\nAnd so, the story of Mr. Sage's hut and the young boy who learned the value of nature and compassion continues to inspire generations, reminding us that by treating all beings with respect and care, we can create a better world for ourselves and future generations." tool_calls_count=0
